---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | Jaipur Balloon Decoration" description="Read the terms and conditions for using Jaipur Balloon Decoration services. Understand our booking policies, cancellation terms, and service scope.">
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#1f2a44]">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#6b7a99]">Last updated: June 2025</p>

		<div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#4f5e7c]">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">By booking any decoration service from Balloon Decor Jaipur (balloondecorjaipur.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not proceed with a booking.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">2. Booking &amp; Confirmation</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">All bookings are subject to availability. A booking is confirmed only after you receive a confirmation from our team via call or WhatsApp. We reserve the right to decline any booking at our discretion.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">3. Pricing</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">All prices displayed on this website are in Indian Rupees (INR) and are inclusive of setup and material costs. Prices may vary based on venue size, location, and specific requirements. Final pricing is confirmed before booking.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">4. Cancellation Policy</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">Cancellations made more than 48 hours before the event may be eligible for a refund as per our Refund Policy. Cancellations within 48 hours of the event are non-refundable. Same-day cancellations will incur the full booking charge.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">5. Service Scope</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">Our decoration services are available within Jaipur and select nearby areas. We bring all materials required for the decoration. The customer is responsible for providing adequate space and electricity access where required.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">6. Liability</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">Balloon Decor Jaipur is not liable for any indirect or consequential damages. Our liability is limited to the value of the booked service. We are not responsible for delays caused by factors beyond our control such as traffic, weather, or venue access restrictions.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">7. Images &amp; Portfolio</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">We may photograph our completed setups for portfolio and marketing purposes. If you do not wish for your event to be photographed, please inform us at the time of booking.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">8. Contact</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">For any queries regarding these terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@balloondecorjaipur.com" class="text-[#6b3fe7] underline">info@balloondecorjaipur.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+918690924378" class="text-[#6b3fe7] underline">+91 86909 24378</a>.</p>
			</section>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#6b3fe7] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white">
				← Back to Home
			</a>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
